# IPv4 / IGMPv2 Leave Group fixture.
# IGMP fixed header: RFC 2236 Type 0x17, Code 0, checksum over the IGMP
# message, and the multicast Group Address being left. The IPv4 destination is
# the RFC 2236 all-routers group.
# Source uses RFC 5737 documentation space and the left group uses RFC 5771
# multicast documentation space; this is not captured live traffic.
45 00 00 1c 17 05 00 00 01 02 00 a7 c0 00 02 32 e0 00 00 02
17 00 fe f1 e9 fc 00 11
